SUMMARY:Get Certified DP-800: Secure\, Optimize\, & Ship SQL+AI Solutions 
 (EMEA/US)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nDP-800 is not just about writing SQ
 L. It’s about delivering database solutions that are secure\, fast\, and
  deployable in modern engineering environments. In this session\, we’ll 
 focus on the engineering practices that turn your database work into produ
 ction-ready solutions.\n\nPre-requisites:\nStudy materials: https://aka.ms
 /dp800/prepare\nJoin Data Days: https://aka.ms/datadays\nRequest a free ex
 am voucher: https://aka.ms/dd/cert
