SUMMARY:Data Days Hotline: No Slides\, Just Answers
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThis is not a polished talk. This i
 s a hotline.\n\nThe questions come straight from the community. You send t
 hem in\, we play them live\, and our experts jump in to figure it out in r
 eal time. No scripts\, no slides\, no perfect answers\, just honest help\,
  ideas\, and the occasional “let’s try this.”\n\nWhether you’re st
 uck\, curious\, or just want to hear how others are solving things in Micr
 osoft Fabric\, SQL\, Power BI\, and AI\, this is where it all comes togeth
 er. You’ll learn something\, hear different perspectives\, and probably 
 realize you’re not the only one asking that question.\n\nPre-requisites:
 \nFind ways to connect: https://aka.ms/dd/connect\nSee what else is happen
 ing during Data Days: https://aka.ms/datadays
