SUMMARY:Get Certified SQL+AI (DP-800): Bring AI to SQL w/Embeddings\, Sear
 ch\, & RAG
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThis is the session everyone’s cu
 rious about: how DP-800 connects modern AI patterns directly to your SQL s
 olutions. We’ll break down what the exam expects around embeddings\, vec
 tors\, intelligent search\, and retrieval augmented generation (RAG) and t
 ranslate it into practical\, buildable concepts.\n\nPre-requisites:\nStudy
  materials: https://aka.ms/dp800/prepare\nJoin Data Days: https://aka.ms/d
 atadays\nRequest a free exam voucher: https://aka.ms/dd/cert
